<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>first day of the second test between South Africa and India in</p>
<p>Cape Town on Thursday:</p>
<p>South Africa first innings</p>
<p> A.Hudson c Mongia b Prasad		 16</p>
<p> G.Kirsten run out			   103</p>
<p> A.Bacher c Mongia b Srinath		25</p>
<p> D.Cullinan c Mongia b Prasad	     77</p>
<p> H.Cronje not out			     35</p>
<p> B.McMillan not out			   13</p>
<p> Extras (lb-6 nb-5)			   11</p>
<p> Total (four wickets)			280</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-37 2-89 3-203 4-251</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 25-6-70-1 (1nb), Prasad 20-1-74-2 (3nb),</p>
<p>Ganesh 13-4-45-0, Kumble 23-1-61-0, Ganguly 9-1-24-0 (1nb)</p>
<p>To bat: Shaun Pollock, Dave Richardson, Lance</p>
<p>Klusener, Allan Donald, Paul Adams.</p>
<p>India - Woorkeri Raman, Nayan Mongia, Rahul</p>
<p>Dravid, Sachin Tendulkar (captain), Saurav Ganguly, Mohammed</p>
<p>Azharuddin, VVS Laxman, Anil Kumble, Javagal Srinath, Venkatesh</p>
<p>Prasad, Doda Ganesh.</p>
